      "section": "_validate_node get/page; reviewed.build_query; generated RecordRef metadata",
      "counterexample": "Two same-generation, same-shaped Key DTOs for the same Record have distinct Key IDs. The old module/element-only comparison admitted an alternate DTO where get/page required the selected Key, allowing components to be interpreted under the wrong Key semantics.",
      "repair": "Generate selected/exact relationship key_id on root/join RecordRefs and compare document, core version, module, Record and Key identity in captured get/page and reviewed page compilation. Reviewed compilation also refuses any root/join RecordRef missing selected Key identity before calling the compiler.",
